Before changing framework dependencies, build the read-only upgrade plan:

```bash
cd backend
go run {{.BridraGoModule}}/cmd/bridra upgrade --plan --root ..
```

When the report says `applyAvailable: true`, apply that exact target:

```bash
cd backend
go run {{.BridraGoModule}}/cmd/bridra upgrade --apply --to <version> --root ..
```

Apply updates only managed dependency, lockfile, and Bridra metadata surfaces,
runs the full verification target, and restores those files on failure.
